      "message": "So the issue was with NetworkStatsCollectionTest calling NetworkTemplate#forceAllNetworkTypes in setUp which maintained a static boolean in NetworkTemplate class with no way to reset it. Adding a way to cleanup this boolean and adding that to tearDown in NetworkStatsCollectionTest seems to have resolved the issue.\nThanks Nathan!",
